#: ../../examples/notebooks/02_propagation_methods.ipynb:60002
msgid "Every method against the analytic Gaussian beam"
msgstr "Chaque méthode face au faisceau gaussien analytique"

#: ../../examples/notebooks/02_propagation_methods.ipynb:60004
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The beam radius grows as $w(z) = w_0 \\sqrt{1 + (z / z_R)^2}$ with the Rayleigh range $z_R = \\pi w_0^2 / \\lambda$ (Siegman, *Lasers*, §17.1)."
msgstr "Le rayon du faisceau croît comme $w(z) = w_0 \\sqrt{1 + (z / z_R)^2}$, avec la longueur de Rayleigh $z_R = \\pi w_0^2 / \\lambda$ (Siegman, *Lasers*, §17.1)."

